  <XDFHEADER>
    <deftitle>Porsche 986 Boxster S ME7.2 (ROM 91003718) — VERIFIED TUNER PACK (Sniff-Tested)</deftitle>
    <description>VERIFIED TUNER DEFINITION PACK for Porsche 986 Boxster S 3.2L ME7.2 (ROM 91003718 / y966ohc.ori).
Contains ONLY code-verified, live-tested, and sniff-tested calibration objects (100% pass in tools/tuner_sniff_test.py).
- C167CR 100% Intel Little-Endian (lsbfirst='1', mmedtypeflags='0x00'/'0x01', positive stride).
- Verified axis orientation (axes.x == cols, axes.y == rows) and real embedded 1D curve X-axes.
- Includes live-proven rev limiters NMAX (0x1675C) &amp; NMAXOG (0x1675E).</description>
    <baseoffset>0</baseoffset>
    <DEFAULTS datasizeinbits="8" sigdigits="3" outputtype="1" signed="0" lsbfirst="1" float="0"/>
    <CATEGORY index="0x1" name="Ignition (Zuendung)"/>
    <CATEGORY index="0x2" name="Fuel &amp; Lambda (Kraftstoff / Gemisch)"/>
    <CATEGORY index="0x3" name="Airflow &amp; Throttle (Luft / Fuellung / MAF)"/>
    <CATEGORY index="0x4" name="Torque Architecture (Momentenmanager)"/>
    <CATEGORY index="0x5" name="Intake &amp; VarioCam (Saugrohr / Nockenwelle)"/>
    <CATEGORY index="0x6" name="Catalyst &amp; Exhaust (Abgas / Katalysator)"/>
    <CATEGORY index="0x7" name="Rev Limiters &amp; Idle (Drehzahlbegrenzer &amp; Leerlauf)"/>
  </XDFHEADER>
