  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x1e" flags="0x0">
    <title>MLHFM - Kennlinie fuer Heissfilmluftmassenmesser (512 Punkte) (MAF Sensor 512-Point Voltage Linearization Curve)</title>
    <description>MLHFM - Kennlinie fuer Heissfilmluftmassenmesser (MAF Transfer Curve)

GERMAN: Linearisierungskurve des Bosch Heissfilm-Luftmassenmessers. Wandelt 0-5V Sensorsignal in kg/h Luftmasse um.
ENGLISH: 512-point MAF voltage calibration curve. Calibrates raw intake air sensor voltage directly into physical air mass flow in kg/h. Essential when upgrading to larger MAF housings or intake pipes.</description>
