  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x1f" flags="0x0">
    <title>KFWDKMSN - Kennfeld fuer Drosselklappen-Sollwinkel (Target Throttle Plate Angle from Demanded Airflow)</title>
    <description>KFWDKMSN - Kennfeld fuer Drosselklappen-Sollwinkel (Inverse Throttle Model)

GERMAN: Sollwert fuer den Drosselklappenwinkel abhaengig von normiertem Luftmassenstrom (mlwdknf_w) und Drehzahl (nmot_w). Mathematisches Inverses zu KFMSNWDK.
ENGLISH: Inverse throttle flow model. Calculates target physical throttle blade angle (%) needed to achieve demanded mass airflow at given RPM.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="2"/>
    <XDFAXIS id="x">
      <units>nmot (RPM)</units>
      <indexcount>6</indexcount>
      <decimalpl>2</decimalpl>
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedaddress="0x15afc" mmedelementsizebits="16" mmedmajorstridebits="16" mmedtypeflags="0x00" lsbfirst="1"/>
      <embedinfo type="1"/>
      <MATH equation="0.25*X">
        <VAR id="X"/>
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
    <XDFAXIS id="y">
      <units>msndko (norm flow)</units>
      <indexcount>16</indexcount>
      <decimalpl>2</decimalpl>
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedaddress="0x15adc" mmedelementsizebits="16" mmedmajorstridebits="16" mmedtypeflags="0x00" lsbfirst="1"/>
      <embedinfo type="1"/>
      <MATH equation="0.1*X">
        <VAR id="X"/>
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
    <XDFAXIS id="z">
      <units>% throttle angle</units>
      <decimalpl>2</decimalpl>
      <min>0.0</min>
      <outputtype>1</outputtype>
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedtypeflags="0x00" mmedaddress="0x15b08" mmedelementsizebits="16" mmedrowcount="16" mmedcolcount="6" signed="0" lsbfirst="1"/>
      <MATH equation="X*100/65535">
        <VAR id="X"/>
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
  </XDFTABLE>
  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x20" flags="0x0">
    <title>KFMIRL - Kennfeld fuer Sollfuellung aus relativem Motormoment (Engine Load Fill Target from Requested Torque)</title>
    <description>KFMIRL - Kennfeld fuer Sollfuellung aus relativem Motormoment (Torque to Load)

GERMAN: Kernkennfeld des Bosch ME7-Momentenmanagers. Berechnet aus dem angeforderten Drehmoment (misopl) die erforderliche Zylinder-Luftfuellung (rl).
ENGLISH: Fundamental Bosch ME7 torque-to-load translation map. Converts requested torque demand into target intake manifold cylinder fill.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="3"/>
    <XDFAXIS id="x">
      <units>misopl (% torque)</units>
      <indexcount>16</indexcount>
      <decimalpl>2</decimalpl>
