  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x22" flags="0x0">
    <title>KFPED - Kennfeld Fahrpedal-Wunschmoment (Driver Demanded Torque vs Accelerator Pedal Position)</title>
    <description>KFPED - Kennfeld Fahrpedal-Wunschmoment (E-Gas Throttle Response)

GERMAN: Wandelt die elektronische Fahrpedalstellung (wped) in ein Fahrer-Wunschmoment um. Bestimmt das Gaspedal-Ansprechverhalten des Autos.
ENGLISH: Drive-by-wire accelerator pedal transfer map. Translates pedal travel percentage into commanded engine torque. Adjusting this modifies throttle sensitivity and linearity.</description>
